# Large curated datasets (promote to hf/ when ready)
outputs/cleaned/
outputs/curated/
outputs/oracle-grounded/
outputs/curated/*.parquet
outputs/curated/*.jsonl.gz

# Round generator scripts (mills). These are one-shot, machine-local generators
# that were never committed: they hardcode this workstation's paths, no tracked
# file imports or invokes them, and CI never sees them. Naming them here keeps
# `git status` readable and keeps local scanners (qlty, bandit) reporting on the
# repository rather than on 156k lines of scratch. The tracked mill modules in
# pipelines/ -- mill_family, mill_evidence, mill_resolution, mill_ownership,
# mill_signals, mill_findings, mill_locations, mill_reviewed_vocabulary,
# leftover_mill, compose_mill, training_audit_mill -- are core code and are
# deliberately NOT matched by any pattern below.
experiments/
scripts/*_mill/
scripts/*_mill.py
pipelines/*_mill.py
pipelines/*_mill_leftover*.py
/mill_*_r*.py
